---
title: "Stripe docs playbook: the spec a caller reads, then one changelog entry"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: waiting
    lg1: product
    lg2: spec
    lg3: habit
    lg4: done
    lg5: failed
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 purple
  class lg3 yellow
  class lg4 teal
  class lg5 orange
  s0: Start
  s1: Reader known
  s2: Stopped: no reader on file
  s3: Product list read
  s4: Card names that reader
  s5: Card names no reader
  s6: Spec has every section
  s7: Spec is missing a section
  s8: Terms written
  s9: Changelog habit proposed
  s10: Check failed: a section is blank
  s11: Check failed: the card names no reader
  s12: Check passed
  s13: Changelog entry written
  s14: Habit and entries listed
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you read who the product is offered to [when the venture has a reader]
  s0 --> s2: you look for a reader and there is none [when the venture has no reader]
  s1 --> s3: you read the product list
  s3 --> s4: you write the product card and name that reader
  s3 --> s5: you write the product card and name no reader
  s4 --> s6: you propose the spec with every section
  s4 --> s7: you propose the spec and leave a section blank
  s5 --> s6: you propose the spec with every section
  s6 --> s8: you write a term for each object in the spec
  s7 --> s8: you write a term for each object in the spec
  s8 --> s9: you propose the changelog habit
  s9 --> s12: you run the checks and they pass [every section is filled and the card names the reader]
  s9 --> s10: you run the checks and they fail [a spec section is blank]
  s9 --> s11: you run the checks and they fail [the card names no reader]
  s12 --> s13: you write a changelog entry
  s13 --> s14: you read the decision list
  class s0 tan
  class s1 blue
  class s2 tan
  class s3 blue
  class s4 blue
  class s5 blue
  class s6 purple
  class s7 purple
  class s8 purple
  class s9 yellow
  class s10 orange
  class s11 orange
  class s12 teal
  class s13 teal
  class s14 teal
